  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In some cases, you may want to change the movement sync mechanism for a pickup - for example, locking it to a bone using local processing, or moving its parent instead. Currently this use case results in a lot of wasted bandwidth and potential desync issues. It would be helpful if we could disable transmission for an object sync component when we want to take full control of it.\n\nOther use cases involve optimizing bandwidth usage of objects that are not currently active.",
